<title>USA: Illinois River grain barge prices - Nov 27.</title>
<headline>Illinois River grain barge prices - Nov 27.</headline>
<text>
<p>Illinois River barge loading terminals bids to producers(dollar/bu)</p>
<p>					South of Peoria  change (cents/bu)</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.73-2.77		up 1-2</p>
<p>US 1 Yellow Soybeans		 7.22-7.25		up 1-2</p>
<p>			  Contract bids for January delivery</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.76-2.80		unc-dn 1</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Soybeans		 7.21-7.24		up 1-2</p>
<p>				   North of Peoria</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.74-2.77		mixed</p>
<p>US 1 Yellow Soybeans		 7.22-7.26		up 2-4</p>
<p>			    Contract bids for January delivery</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.74-2.76		dn 1-2</p>
<p>US 1 Yellow Soybeans		 7.20-7.22		up 2-3</p>
<p>Source: USDA</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
